BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canvass for Labor's Own\, Dave Madsen!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T103000
UID:61a77fda28353df64df459b0a83a0723@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/madsen_20260419143818292497.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, 4/26 at 11AM and 1PM in Dauphin County to 
 make sure that union member and labor champion Dave Madsen comes back to t
 he PA State House! We'll be knocking doors to let the good people of the 1
 04th House District about the great work that Dave has done\, protecting t
 he rights of working people and fighting for their community. Let's get it
  done!
LOCATION:150 S 43rd St\, Harrisburg\, PA\, 17111
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/izzyforlancaster/event/941713/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
