DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T170000
UID:d67945e71aad8527ca53ff4f14bde494@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/event_pollgreeter_20250731150018235832.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Poll Greeters are needed at all 16 of Warwick's polling places
  throughout the day on Election Day! Poll Greeters hand out sample ballots
  and candidate literature\, answer voter questions\, and are a friendly fa
 ce for local Democrats coming to vote. ### ✳ Upcoming Election Dates: - 
 **2026 Primary Election:** Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026 - **2026 General Electi
 on:** Tuesday\, November 3\, 2026 **Please make sure to enter your correct
  phone number and email address.** Your RSVP on this page is not final—w
 e'll
LOCATION:Lititz\, PA\, 17543
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/559186/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Anti-Fascist Craft Night in Lititz with the Warwick Democrats!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260506T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260506T170000
UID:65499a466127d9fde85d37a8f301e4b8@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/anti-facist_craft_night_20250731134502634757.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We love democracy. We love crafts. We love snacks. And we love
  civic engagement. You too? Join us for **Anti-Fascist Craft Night** in Li
 titz—a low-key hang where we cut up cereal boxes and old magazines\, mak
 e wild collage postcards and letters\, and send our thoughts (and shade) t
 o our elected officials. Make your voice heard in a weirdly therapeutic an
 d hands-on way! **What to bring:** * Clean cardboard (cereal/snack boxes) 
 or card stock * Old magazines\, catalogs\, newspapers\, greeting cards\, e
 tc
LOCATION:Lititz\, PA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/821867/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
